      -> expected [ 'AC-1', 'AC-2', 'AC-3' ] to strictly equal [ 'AC-1', 'AC-3' ]
  x returns an ARRAY, so lodash difference sees its elements instead of nothing
      -> expected [ 'AC-2', 'AC-3' ] to strictly equal [ 'AC-3' ]
  x de-duplicates an AC two scenarios both tag, keeping document order
